1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
To understand GTA 6, step away from the
lights of Vice City.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,240
Rockstar takes Jason and Lucia’s story
across the state of Leonida.

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,680
Its official guide highlights six places.

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,100
We’ll start in the city, then follow the
water and the roads.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,260
Vice City. By day, the beach.

6
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,940
At night, a glowing Ferris wheel.

7
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,420
Rockstar names four spots in the city:

8
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:32,740
Ocean Beach, with its Art Deco hotels;
Little Cuba and its bakeries; the

9
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:36,340
Tisha-Wocka flea market; and VC Port, the
cruise port.

10
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,880
The city changes as you head inland.

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,020
Leonida Keys. Below the seaplane, a bridge
links two islands.

12
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,140
Another shot takes us underwater.

13
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,240
Divers and a sea turtle move among the
coral.

14
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:54,740
Rockstar shows this tropical island chain
from above and below the water.

15
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:58,400
Grassrivers takes us into mangrove
wetlands.

16
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:03,160
In Rockstar’s overhead shot, alligators
surround an airboat.

17
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:07,980
Another image shows a police chase cutting
through that same landscape.

18
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,760
Port Gellhorn sits on the coast.

19
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:16,660
Rockstar describes a former resort town.

20
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:21,140
Shuttered attractions and empty shopping
areas are remnants of those days.

21
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:24,260
At night, a motel sign still glows.

22
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:27,720
In another shot, so does a cabaret sign.

23
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,900
Smokestacks shape Ambrosia’s skyline at
night.

24
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:36,580
Rockstar puts the Allied Crystal sugar
refinery at the heart of local employment.

25
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:40,440
Another image shows bikers lined up in
matching leather vests.

26
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:44,880
The refinery and the local motorcycle gang
are two forces in the region.

27
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:51,580
Rockstar’s official guide takes us to
Mount Kalaga National Park, on Leonida’s

28
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:56,480
northern border. There are wooded ridges,
roads winding through hills, and dirt

29
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,340
bikes in the mud.

30
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,440
Then the pavement disappears.

31
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,680
A kayak moves along a stream between the
trees.

32
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,760
These images can’t tell us where the
borders are, how far apart the places are,

33
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,720
or exactly where the roads go.

34
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:17,100
They do show how Leonida’s pace changes as
we leave Vice City’s lights behind.

35
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,500
One moment we’re underwater.

36
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,140
The next, we’re deep in the woods.
